---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="This page states what the inquiry form collects, why TurbineBridge keeps it, and how to ask what we hold about you."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="What the inquiry form collects."
    lede="A plain account of what the inquiry forms on this site collect and why."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-inner prose">
      <p>
        The inquiry forms on this site collect your name, company, email, phone, interest, and message. Name, email, interest, and message are required. Company and phone are optional.
      </p>
      <p>
        We use what you send so we can reply and carry the conversation. That is the purpose of the form.
      </p>
      <p>
        The host that serves this site stores the submission so TurbineBridge Energy Solutions LLC (TBES) can read it. We do not sell inquiries. This site does not use third-party advertising trackers, so there are none to list.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can ask what the company holds about you. Use the <a class="link" href="/contact">contact form</a> and say what you want to know.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
